  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_briar_frenzy": {
        "skill2": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Chilling Scream<>: Briar charges for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, taking <#ffb900ff>15%<> less damage and healing <#6aff55ff>24<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>16% AD<>, then screams forward for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by <#ffb900ff>80%<> and <#ef5350ff>knocking back<>; champions knocked into a wall or unit are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Certain Death<>: Briar kicks her hemolith, marking the first champion hit (it passes minions), and flies to it. Landing deals <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around her and <#ef5350ff>fears<> other enemies for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Till the prey falls she's in <#ff9028ff>Hemomania<>: Blood Frenzy plus <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>20 armor<> and magic resist, <#6aff55ff>10% life steal<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% more Move Speed<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_briar_frenzy": {
        "skill2": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>오싹한 비명<>: <#ffb900ff>1초<> 동안 충전하며 받는 피해 <#ffb900ff>15%<> 감소, 체력 <#6aff55ff>24<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 16%<> 회복. 이후 앞으로 비명을 질러 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 90%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>, <#ef5350ff>둔화<> <#ffb900ff>80%<>, <#ef5350ff>넉백<>; 벽이나 유닛에 부딪힌 챔피언은 <#ffb900ff>1초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>.",
        "ult": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>불가항력적 죽음<>: 혈석을 차 처음 맞힌 챔피언(미니언 통과)을 표시하고 날아갑니다. 착지 시 주변에 <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 60%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>, 먹잇감 외의 적 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> <#ef5350ff>공포<>. 먹잇감이 쓰러질 때까지 피의 갈증: 핏빛 광분 효과, <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>방어력 20<>·마저, <#6aff55ff>생명력 흡수 10%<>, <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>이동 속도 25%<> 추가."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_briar_frenzy": {
        "skill2": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>呪福の叫び<>：<#ffb900ff>1秒<>溜めて被ダメージ<#ffb900ff>15%<>軽減、体力<#6aff55ff>24<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の16%<>回復。前方に叫び<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の90%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>、<#ef5350ff>スロウ<><#ffb900ff>80%<>と<#ef5350ff>ノックバック<>、壁かユニットにぶつかったチャンピオンは<#ffb900ff>1秒<><#ef5350ff>スタン<>。",
        "ult": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>迫りくる死<>：魔石を蹴り、最初に当たったチャンピオン（ミニオン貫通）へ飛ぶ。着地で周囲に<#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の60%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>、獲物以外に<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<><#ef5350ff>フィアー<>。獲物が倒れるまで渇血状態：血の狂乱、<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>物理防御20<>と魔防、<#6aff55ff>ライフスティール10%<>、<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度25%<>追加。"
      }
    }
  }
